いな特殊な配列のキーボードに慣れてしまうと、普通のキーボードに戻れなくなるんじゃないかと思うとなかなか手が出しづらいんですよね\nそのキーボードしか使わない、と割り切れるなら良いんですけど。すごい便利そうなので。","ts":"1629526013.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ylw1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da18a349-a111-4ee7-bca1-b62d7973d8bd","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"φ(..)メモメモ","ts":"1629515126.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"19lZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0581b98-d08e-436b-88c4-1f86d3d57878","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u003chttps://skyhigh-works.booth.pm/items/2470855\u003e\nDumangDK6が壊れたときのバックアップとして、これが気になる。\n格子配列は同時押し打鍵の配列とキーボードと相性悪いので、通常の並びのほうがほしい。","ts":"1629511026.031400","attachments":[{"fallback":"JP60 Split(Otaku Split v2) - 天高工房 - BOOTH","id":1,"title":"JP60 Split(Otaku Split v2) - 天高工房 - BOOTH","title_link":"https://skyhigh-works.booth.pm/items/2470855","text":"日本語配列分割キーボードDIYキットです。 自身ではんだづけなどで組み立てをして自分のキーボードを作りましょう。 プレートデータは公開する予定です。 特徴:6YBが両側 特徴:Hが左にもある 特徴:日本語普及配列のメイン部分(60%部分)をほぼそのままの相対配置 特徴:親指に大量のキー 基板色:白 スイッチ取付方式はソケット・はんだづけ両対応で、ソケットの場合はLED穴が上に配置される向きになるため、Cherry Profileのキーキャップで底打ち時にスイッチとキーキャップがぶつかることがあります。","image_url":"https://booth.pximg.net/c/620x620/4394ec37-d0ff-4c92-8f78-5c08d0566da6/i/2470855/148a37f5-3c50-4151-9e0d-499ca08316e7_base_resized.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"skyhigh-works.booth.pm","service_icon":"https://skyhigh-works.booth.pm/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://skyhigh-works.booth.pm/items/2470855","original_url":"https://skyhigh-works.booth.pm/items/2470855"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4feJ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3075d616-106d-4901-85ab-14d55d283231","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"左小指9個に対して、右小指は15個ある。","ts":"1629510653.030200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H6EeC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6d7e2f3-520a-466a-b022-52982e12b7a5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁそれもありますが、右手の小指に割り当たってるキーが凄く多いんですよ。","ts":"1629510528.029500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QMMAr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9ff45ff-9d4d-4bb4-a909-a95f4516cf76","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"あー、Ctrlが左側だからCtrlの操作が多いと左手の負荷がひどくなるか","ts":"1629510239.028700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cXA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd557c3b-ebe7-4de4-af74-65d349a73487","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"左右分割HHKBが美しくないのは、せっかく割ったのに左右の手の負荷が大きく違うのはなんなんだ、って気持ちになるんですよね。特に右手の小指の仕事がめっちゃ多いままなのアレだし、左右非対称のままである動機が極めて薄いしで。","ts":"1629509836.027700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CANm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb77bfb0-971a-415b-8c59-0f637c40ecc2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"コチキーボードさんところの Corne キット\n\n\u003chttps://kochikeyboard.stores.jp/?category_id=5f65ea9193f6192d81e6aeea\u003e","ts":"1629509555.026100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q6x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A14A2AD3-ECB2-4A9A-8708-51244A694BC8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分も少し気になってるので値段と相談ですね","ts":"1629503174.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GsL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29dd984d-4c2e-4f6e-bc1a-9478abaa7c54","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"Corneはとても気になっています。分割型キーボードを作るなら、Corneを入門としてやってみたい。","ts":"1629500735.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"corn","count":3,"users":["U03C4RC8X","U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"